    {
     "phrase": "Val, explain three ways to make a film scene feel tense without using dialogue.",
     "speech_end_to": {
      "endpoint_seen": 901.4,
      "words_provisional_after": 901.4,
      "committed_seen": 2017.0,
      "owner_message_canonical": 2038.4,
      "answered_seen": 11765.4,
      "answer_read_via_answered": 11775.1,
      "turn_appended": 27759.3,
      "answer_read_via_turn": 27771.0,
      "first_playback_start": 8672.3
     },
     "segments": [
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 57,
       "text": "My lord,\n\nI do not have a book on film\u2011scene tension yet,",
       "message_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
       "pieces": 5,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 4.16,
       "arrived_ms": 8672.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 8672.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": null,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 19098.8,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 3102.8
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 97,
       "text": "and I will not pretend to one.  \nHere are three ways to make a scene feel tense without dialogue:",
       "message_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
       "pieces": 6,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.12,
       "arrived_ms": 11238.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 12832.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 1594.2,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 14938.8,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 114,
       "text": "1. **Lighting and colour contrast** \u2013 Use sharp, high\u2011contrast lighting or a sudden shift from warm to cold tones.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 7,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.16,
       "arrived_ms": 13132.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 17952.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 4819.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 9818.8,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 86,
       "text": "The abrupt change can create unease, hinting that something unseen is about to happen.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 6,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.44,
       "arrived_ms": 15165.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 24112.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 8947.2,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 3658.8,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 125,
       "text": "2. **Camera movement and framing** \u2013 Employ a slow, deliberate dolly or handheld jitter that follows a character\u2019s breathing.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 8,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 7.36,
       "arrived_ms": 16955.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 29552.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 12596.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -1781.2,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 112,
       "text": "Tight framing on an object while the rest of the frame remains empty can suggest isolation and impending danger.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 7,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.24,
       "arrived_ms": 19265.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 36912.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 17646.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -9141.2,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 141,
       "text": "3. **Sound design and silence** \u2013 Layer subtle, low\u2011frequency drones or distant percussion that rise gradually, then cut abruptly to silence.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 10,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.96,
       "arrived_ms": 21307.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 43152.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 21845.2,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -15381.2,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 112,
       "text": "The absence of sound after a build\u2011up forces the audience\u2019s attention on what might emerge, amplifying suspense.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 7,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.48,
       "arrived_ms": 24119.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 52112.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 27993.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -24341.2,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 99,
       "text": "These techniques rely on visual and auditory cues alone, allowing the scene to speak without words.",
       "message_id": "01a0dcac-ee3c-7cdf-af83-ed6ee4946679",
       "pieces": 6,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.6,
       "arrived_ms": 26249.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 58592.3,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 32343.3,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -30821.2,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      }
     ]
    }
